/E (Every single morning, national television and global headlines tell us what India feels. They tell us our youth are disillusioned, how we view our future, and whether our democracy is working. But if you stop for ten seconds and ask a basic, honest question: Yeh number laya kaun? The entire illusion starts to crumble. )
